            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.0.2</h3>
<ul>
<li>Links from pinned tabs (like Gmail) that go to another site now open in Glance, like Arc. Press ⌘Return to keep one as a tab.</li>
<li>Turn it off in Settings › General › Open links from pinned tabs in Glance.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
